            <!-- lf:reply task=github:acme/acme-api#123 -->
            
            The `Coding Agent: …` label on this issue does not name a usable coding-agent tool. Nothing was run: litefactory refuses a run it cannot resolve the coding-agent tool for rather than falling back to a different one.
            
